@amyklobuchar @Amy_Siskind America could do w/ a tough, responsive, take-no-nonsense president right now.

This isn't American Idol, folks. 𝐼𝑡'𝑠 𝑎 𝑗𝑜𝑏 𝑖𝑛𝑡𝑒𝑟𝑣𝑖𝑒𝑤.

You &amp; I are doing the hiring; We're hiring someone to be President. Who can best do that job? is the only question that matters.

@nolanolegal And Arkansas presumably did its own due diligence before hiring him. So that makes three institutions now. 

Each subsequent job he gets makes it less about Kendal Briles and more of a systemic what-the-fuck-are-we-doing-here?

And there are several spokes to that wheel.

